# p3·12 measurement artifacts — probe-shots.mjs writes here. These are
# evidence for a review, not source; the repo already ignores .shots for the
# same reason.
shots/

# p4·06 — scratch probes. `git add -A` swept three of these into a commit in
# this very release, the hazard CLAUDE.md already records twice (p3·13,
# p3·15). Caught by sweeping `git ls-tree` — the COMMITTED tree — rather than
# `git status`, because a clean status says nothing about what is already
# committed. Ignoring the prefix makes the class impossible instead of
# repeatedly caught. `scripts/probe-*.mjs` are real committed tools and are
# deliberately NOT matched by this pattern.
.probe-*
